meta {
  name: Add boat (pursuit offset rejected 400)
  type: http
  seq: 27
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/sessions/:id/boats
  body: json
  auth: none
}

params:path {
  id: 1
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "deviceId": "{{deviceId}}",
    "startOffsetSec": 45
  }
}

docs {
  Pursuit/handicap starts were REMOVED (todo 13): every boat shares the session
  gun, so a per-boat offset is meaningless.

  Expect 400:
  {"error":"startOffsetSec is no longer supported — every boat shares the session gun (pursuit starts were removed)"}

  A zero offset is still accepted (it is a no-op); only a nonzero one is
  rejected, and it is rejected loudly rather than silently ignored.
}